<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.5000 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.5000 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.5000 per</p>
<p>dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Thursday after</p>
<p>75.6500 on Wednesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     June 5		  June 4</p>
<p> High			     75.6999		 75.7000</p>
<p> Low				75.4503		 75.4100</p>
<p> Open			     75.6900		 75.4100</p>
<p> Close			    75.5000		 75.6500</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	     2.035		   1.835</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
